		(descr "RAMXEED/Fujitsu 8-pin plastic DFN, LCC-8P-M05: 5.00x6.00mm body, 0.90mm MAX height, bottom-contact terminals recessed under the body (tip-to-tip 4.00mm, length 0.60mm, width 0.40mm, pitch 1.27mm BSC). Land derived from DS501-00087-1v0-E p.21 (no vendor-recommended pattern published). Pads carry an extended outer toe past the 5.00mm body edge for hand-solder iron access; reflow/hot-air is the primary intended process. For MB85RC512TYPN-GS-AWEWE1 (and family).")
